# Normalize line endings: Go code, JSON schemas, configs, and shell scripts
# must stay LF everywhere (Windows checkouts with autocrlf would otherwise
# break byte comparisons like the schema drift test, and CRLF breaks sh).
* text=auto
*.go text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
